    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Leave a 🧡 below to affirm! \n\nHey, love. I don’t know what the last five months have looked like for you. Maybe they’ve been beautiful and life-changing in the best ways. Maybe they’ve been heavy. Maybe they’ve tested your very core. Maybe they’ve felt stagnant. Or maybe they’ve been a mix of all of that.\n\nEither way, I hope this month brings you a little more peace, a little more clarity, a little more laughter, and a few reasons to believe that things can get better. I want to remind you of how far you’ve come, and how capable you are. This month, really love on yourself and empower yourself with all of the beautiful things that make you, you. \n\nYou have a great level of self-awareness. What will you do with it? \n\nRooting for you, always. 🫶🏽\n\nWritten by: @williegreene_\n\nFor more daily healing, order the book at wetheurban.com (more in bio)",
    "word_count": 161
  },
